obloquenti, et calumnianti quod</HI>  Virgo virginum  <HI REND="ITALIC">diceretur.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM><COL N="CXLD"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Miscellaneorum</HI> <NOTE N="(167)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="CXLD" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="CXLD"></COL> Miscellaneorum et Excerptionum libros Oudinus
tom. II, pag. 1146 seqq. Hugonis Victorini esse
