Hispalensem</HI> <NOTE N="(168)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="CXLD" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="CXLD"></COL> Seorsim exstat edita tom. II, col. 1014.  <ED>EDIT.</ED></NOTE> , quae lib. I, cap. 80, pag. 119,
